# Cloud Consultancy - Automated Lead & Newsletter Dispatcher
# Recipient inbox for all inquiries & newsletter subscriptions:
NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=team.onlinedigitalsolution@gmail.com

# Gmail SMTP Settings:
# To deliver directly from your Gmail account:
# 1. Sign in to team.onlinedigitalsolution@gmail.com
# 2. Go to Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification (turn ON if not already)
# 3. Search for "App Passwords" or visit: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Create an App password (name it e.g. "Website Contact Form")
# 5. Paste the 16-character password into SMTP_PASS below (no spaces):
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true
SMTP_USER=team.onlinedigitalsolution@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=
SMTP_FROM="Cloud Consultancy" <team.onlinedigitalsolution@gmail.com>

# Alternative: If using a custom transactional service like Resend or SendGrid:
# RESEND_API_KEY=
